by nicolas-grekas at 2026-10-07T15:18:23Z

I pushed a few changes. Like `#[RateLimit]` since #66644, the lock is now acquired before the controller arguments are resolved, unless the key reads them: a request that waited for the lock doesn't run with arguments loaded before the wait anymore, and a rejected one doesn't resolve them at all. Promoting a read lock to a write lock doesn't wait anymore either, as two requests doing so would wait for each other.

